        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9027/153, 6 Inch Cabinet Bar Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 6 Inch Cabinet Handle is available in a huge selection of modern finishes including chrome, nickel, and brass. This 6 Inch Cabinet Bar Pull is made by Omnia, so you can be sure that it will look great for years to come. The modern style makes it ideal for contemporary homes and the 6 inch length is nice because it accommodates large hands and looks fantastic at the same time. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9027\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/10-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-long-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9027 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
